  "prompt": "Cho góc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>α</mi></semantics></math> thoả mãn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. Tính giá trị của biểu thức sau (làm tròn đến phần chục)\n\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mo>tan</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
